{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an arena fighter and earn glory by defeating your enemies and making it to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Entertain The Crowd</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get paid out after each fight based on how well you entertained the crowd. Use your gold to buy weapons, shields, and armor. The crowd likes when you put on a show, so attack, parry, and emote on your enemies to gain popularity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Choose Your Combat Style</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between using a sword and shield, dual wielding, or using beefy two-handed weapons. Each style has it's own benefits and drawbacks. Block, dodge, parry, and tank hits the way you see fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Level Up Your Skills and Unlock Powerful Special Abilities</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points that you can spend on 6 different skill types. Choose a main class and unlock a special ability that will make each class build unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enchant Your Gear</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul points through fights and use them to enchant your weapons. Watch out though: not all enchantments are good! You can choose to play it safe or hope your gamble pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Face Challenging Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up the ladder of glory, defeating each of the top ranked arena fighters on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Random Arenas And Events</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain the crowd in different arenas with random events, making each fight come with it's own unique challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Interact With The Town</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the people of the town and help them out to get bonuses that will help you on your way to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features -</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite fighting - Challenging and dynamic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer - Become champions together with up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System - Buy starting classes with in game currency you get from defeating bosses, or unlock your class as you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty adjustments - from easy to gladiator mode, choose what fits your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck - Gamble for the most powerful enchantments and face beneficial or harmful events each fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered emotes - Use emotes strategically to gain favor with the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges - Each run will have new challenges randomly chosen based on the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave - Stop whenever and pick back up where you left off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974390?t=1759845068","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974390?t=1759845068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/a015b80f2de60398c0229b4c8c35078a1317445a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759845068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/a015b80f2de60398c0229b4c8c35078a1317445a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759845068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an arena fighter and earn glory by defeating your enemies and making it to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Entertain The Crowd</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get paid out after each fight based on how well you entertained the crowd. Use your gold to buy weapons, shields, and armor. The crowd likes when you put on a show, so attack, parry, and emote on your enemies to gain popularity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9329dab37571799b9169590018eb51a4.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Choose Your Combat Style</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between using a sword and shield, dual wielding, or using beefy two-handed weapons. Each style has it's own benefits and drawbacks. Block, dodge, parry, and tank hits the way you see fit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/3bac2585142bf296e440e5b01dd28304.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Level Up Your Skills and Unlock Powerful Special Abilities</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skill points that you can spend on 6 different skill types. Choose a main class and unlock a special ability that will make each class build unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/f58a9d06f13b18a564652a788159ba63.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enchant Your Gear</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain soul points through fights and use them to enchant your weapons. Watch out though: not all enchantments are good! You can choose to play it safe or hope your gamble pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/af04944a25cb874f3efec1de16618a0b.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Face Challenging Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb your way up the ladder of glory, defeating each of the top ranked arena fighters on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.poster.avif?t=1759845068\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.webm?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/extras/9fd90ceb290f462c3e1c55a1cbe92dfa.mp4?t=1759845068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Random Arenas And Events</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertain the crowd in different arenas with random events, making each fight come with it's own unique challenges.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Interact With The Town</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the people of the town and help them out to get bonuses that will help you on your way to the top!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features -</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-lite fighting - Challenging and dynamic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer - Become champions together with up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class System - Buy starting classes with in game currency you get from defeating bosses, or unlock your class as you go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty adjustments - from easy to gladiator mode, choose what fits your skill level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your luck - Gamble for the most powerful enchantments and face beneficial or harmful events each fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overpowered emotes - Use emotes strategically to gain favor with the crowd</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new challenges - Each run will have new challenges randomly chosen based on the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave - Stop whenever and pick back up where you left off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Big W Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974390/7d4b63a0e6af83cb5674500f971a705b326bd2c3/header.jpg?t=1759845068","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974390/608092470/0d7304fdd2fb789e643f8be50b94966b1c4931e7/1759090402/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759093749","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974390/608092470/0d7304fdd2fb789e643f8be50b94966b1c4931e7/1759090402/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759093749","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3974390/608092470/0d7304fdd2fb789e643f8be50b94966b1c4931e7/1759090402/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759093749","id":257208120,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208120/movie480.mp4?t=1759093749","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208120/movie_max.mp4?t=1759093749"},"name":"The Arena Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208120/9d4b1d78a45320f59f048fecfd9625a10040e4cf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759093749","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208120/movie480.webm?t=1759093749","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208120/movie_max.webm?t=1759093749"}}],"name":"The Arena","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or 